Description: Expose in-memory string generation on
    AnnotatedBinaryTextGenerator and apply annotator stability fixes.
    This enables dynamic inspection of annotated binary buffers without
    forcing disk writes, avoids verification failures on schemas
    lacking standard file identifiers, and stabilizes trailer
    alignment parsing.
    Implemented by adding AnnotatedBinaryTextGenerator::GenerateString()
    to src/annotated_binary_text_gen.cpp, updating
    BinaryAnnotator::Annotate in src/binary_annotator.cpp to verify
    buffers using the raw Type VerifyBuffer<reflection::Schema>(nullptr)
    API directly, and adjusting the trailing section check in
    FixMissingSections to handle boundary offset <= binary_length_
    comparison safely.


